    <briefdescription>
<para>This class define an interface similar to the <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_l_t_o_code_generator" kindref="compound">LTOCodeGenerator</ref>, but adapted for ThinLTO processing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_thin_l_t_o_code_generator" kindref="compound">ThinLTOCodeGenerator</ref> is not intended to be reuse for multiple compilation: the model is that the client adds modules to the generator and ask to perform the ThinLTO optimizations / codegen, and finally destroys the codegenerator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
